## Mechanism: the gradient lives entirely in the curator-filled rows

- LR interaction (age x was_imputed), linear: chi2=38.65, df=1, p=0.0; with quadratic interaction: chi2=39.642, df=2, p=0.0
- Interaction model: age slope among non-imputed rows = -0.0004 (p=0.968); ADDITIONAL slope inside filled rows = -0.1513 (p=0); extra quadratic = -0.0110 (p=0.321)
- Separate stratum fits: filled-rows-only OR/yr = 0.872 (0.837-0.908, p=0.0); clean-rows-only OR/yr = 1.015 (0.994-1.036, p=0.15819858)
- was_imputed indicator model: OR = 0.272 (p=0), AME = -0.2727; age terms shrink to AGE_c=-0.0327 (p=0.0009), AGE_c2=-0.0052 (p=0.246)
- Imputed share by age: {'24': 0.2869, '25': 0.2892, '26': 0.2621, '27': 0.2599, '28': 0.3252, '29': 0.3815, '30': 0.4106, '31': 0.4043, '32': 0.467}
- Imputed share by outcome: {'0': 0.3865, '1': 0.17}  (0.39 among DISSAVED=0 vs 0.17 among DISSAVED=1)

